        <mxCell id="0IvHbam1iwFZeJU0NXRJ-10" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Hinman v. Pacific Air&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- from the center of the earth to the sky&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="240" x="940" y="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="0IvHbam1iwFZeJU0NXRJ-11" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Issue&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- does a 100 meters up from the ground in plane constitute trespass ?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="240" x="750" y="260" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="0IvHbam1iwFZeJU0NXRJ-12" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Facts&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- Hinman lived near an airport and planes flew very close to his house.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- on public policy grounds can&#39;t hold from the land to the stars&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- no actual or substantive damages only nominal;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="240" x="1140" y="260" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="0IvHbam1iwFZeJU0NXRJ-13" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Rules&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- the owner of land owns as much of the space above him as he uses, but only so long as he can use it. All that lies beyond, belongs to the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;- nominal damages is not enough for airspace&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="135" width="240" x="960" y="495" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x5Cy5XgLjUDae-BZAYRX-1" parent="1" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-align: center; text-decoration-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Issue&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border-style:solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(1) can nominal damages for int. trespass support punitive damages&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- YES, court has reason to penalize those who intentionally break the right of trespass. &quot;No practical meaning unless protected by the state&quot;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(2) should it be applied to Steenberg&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;- &lt;i&gt;Yes, $30 was a &quot;halfpenny&quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;(3) is 100,000 excessive&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;- &lt;/span&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;Not excessive&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="210" width="240" x="10" y="270" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
